{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissAction","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" environment value to get the instance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of this structure for a given ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Then call the instance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to perform the dismissal. You call the instance directly because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it defines a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/callAsFunction()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method that Swift calls when you call the instance.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, you can create a button that calls the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct SheetContents: View {","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Done\") {","            dismiss()","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you present the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SheetContents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view in a sheet, the user can dismiss","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sheet by tapping or clicking the sheet’s button:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            SheetContents()","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Be sure that you define the action in the appropriate environment.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, don’t reorganize the ","type":"text"},{"code":"DetailView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the example above","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so that it creates the ","type":"text"},{"code":"dismiss","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property and calls it from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"View\/sheet(item:onDismiss:content:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view modifier’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"closure:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    @State private var isSheetPresented = false","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss \/\/ Applies to DetailView.","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Show Sheet\") {","            isSheetPresented = true","        }","        .sheet(isPresented: $isSheetPresented) {","            Button(\"Done\") {","                dismiss() \/\/ Fails to dismiss the sheet.","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you do this, the sheet fails to dismiss because the action applies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the environment where you declared it, which is that of the detail"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view, rather than the sheet. In fact, if you’ve presented the detail"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view in a "},{"code":"NavigationView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the dismissal pops the detail view","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the navigation stack."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The dismiss action has no effect on a view that isn’t currently","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presented. If you need to query whether OpenSwiftUI is currently presenting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a view, read the ","type":"text"},{"code":"EnvironmentValues\/isPresented","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" environment value.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/init(action:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/callAsFunction()"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissAction"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s9EscapableP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"An action that dismisses a presentation.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismissaction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DismissAction"